        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Range</strong> 60 feet</p><p><strong>Targets</strong> 1 creature that owes you a debt or that failed a Will save against one of your effects this encounter</p><p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> Will</p><hr /><p>The target must succeed at a Will save against your class DC or take 8d6 mental damage and become <em>enfeebled 2</em> for 1 minute as the full weight of what it owes lands at once (on a critical failure it also falls <em>prone</em>). On a success, it takes half damage only.</p>"
